\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces E1 service benefit and incumbent cost. Clustered bars show site--policy mean completion time, missed deadlines and incumbent services damaged at the horizon. Whiskers are 95\% seed-block intervals (240 runs, 20 seed blocks per site and policy). All bars start at zero; zero-width intervals have coincident caps. Colors identify policies consistently across the result figures. Supplementary Table S1 retains exact values.}}{17}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:fig03}{{3}{17}{E1 service benefit and incumbent cost. Clustered bars show site--policy mean completion time, missed deadlines and incumbent services damaged at the horizon. Whiskers are 95\% seed-block intervals (240 runs, 20 seed blocks per site and policy). All bars start at zero; zero-width intervals have coincident caps. Colors identify policies consistently across the result figures. Supplementary Table S1 retains exact values}{figure.3}{}}
